%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 114 58
%%Title: bracket (40 x 20 mm plate, a 6 mm hole, a rounded corner)
%%EndComments
% 1 mm = 72/25.4 pt
72 25.4 div dup scale
0.2 setlinewidth
newpath
0 0 moveto 40 0 lineto 40 15 lineto 35 15 5 0 90 arc 0 20 lineto closepath
stroke
newpath 20 10 3 0 360 arc closepath stroke
showpage
%%EOF
